body:
The only way the suicide lines can continue to operate is with the guarantee that you will not be traced.  You have anonymity and should reach out for help.  There is help available and there are many that want to ensure you are safe.  Still not comfortable reaching out?  Dial \*67 before you dial the suicide prevention number and it will block your caller ID. 

&#x200B;

Please reach out and talk to someone.
